Third-party code in src/port/riscv64
====================================

The five files listed below come from FreeBSD and newlib, copied byte for
byte and never edited. The other files in this folder (port_memcpy.S,
port_memmove.S and port_memset.S) belong to libterae and are under
libterae's licence, given at the top of each of them.

machine/asm.h carries the full text of its licence. The other four files
name their licence without its text, which is therefore given at the end of
this file: text A for files 1 and 2, text B for files 4 and 5.


